---
/*
  The system map: one main locus owning three children, two typed topics
  above them on the broker plane, and each child's placement. Ownership is
  drawn in hairline, communication in the route colour; both come from the
  page's tokens, so the drawing follows the theme.
*/
---
<figure class="sysmap" aria-label="A main locus named Telemetry owns three loci, Ingest, Rollup and Metrics. Ingest publishes Samples, which Rollup subscribes to; Rollup publishes Snapshot, which Metrics subscribes to. Each child carries a placement.">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 400" role="img">
      <path class="own" d="M500 92 C500 160 165 160 165 262"/>
      <path class="own" d="M500 92 V262"/>
      <path class="own" d="M500 92 C500 160 835 160 835 262"/>
      <line class="rail-line" x1="40" y1="200" x2="960" y2="200"/>
      <path class="route" d="M165 262 V200 H470 V262"/>
      <path class="route" d="M530 262 V200 H835 V262"/>
      <circle class="dot" cx="330" cy="200" r="3.5"/><text class="topic" x="300" y="188">Samples</text>
      <circle class="dot" cx="690" cy="200" r="3.5"/><text class="topic" x="658" y="188">Snapshot</text>
      <text class="k" x="40" y="236">typed broker plane · topics sit above publishers and subscribers</text>
      <rect class="box" x="390" y="40" width="220" height="52" rx="4"/>
      <text class="k" x="402" y="58">main locus</text><text x="402" y="79">Telemetry · owns the root</text>
      <rect class="box" x="35" y="262" width="260" height="70" rx="4"/>
      <text class="k" x="47" y="280">locus</text><text x="47" y="300">Ingest · socket, receive arena</text><text class="pl" x="47" y="320">placement: pinned, core 1</text>
      <rect class="box" x="370" y="262" width="260" height="70" rx="4"/>
      <text class="k" x="382" y="280">locus</text><text x="382" y="300">Rollup · windows, counters</text><text class="pl" x="382" y="320">placement: pool, compute</text>
      <rect class="box" x="705" y="262" width="260" height="70" rx="4"/>
      <text class="k" x="717" y="280">locus</text><text x="717" y="300">Metrics · HTTP server state</text><text class="pl" x="717" y="320">placement: pool, io</text>
    </svg>
    <div class="legend"><span><i></i>ownership and lifetime</span><span><i class="r"></i>communication through a typed topic</span><span>placement, named on each locus</span></div>
  </figure>
